-- Icons Row 1

      button .AddPipe  at x1 ymax+0.3   tooltip 'Add Pipe'       pixmap width 18 height 18 call |Call !!MdsAddPipe(!!MdsFT50)|
      button .AddHVAC  at xmax+0.1 ymin tooltip 'Add HVAC'       pixmap width 18 height 18 call |Call !!MdsAddHvac(!!MdsFT50)|
      button .AddRack  at xmax+0.1 ymin tooltip 'Add Rack'       pixmap width 18 height 18 call |Call !!MdsAddRack(!!MdsFT50)|
      button .AddBar   at xmax+0.1 ymin tooltip 'Add Cross Bar'  pixmap width 18 height 18 call |Call !!MdsAddBarFT50(_Support, 'NEW')|
      button .Flip     at xmax+0.1 ymin tooltip 'Mirror Frame'   pixmap width 18 height 18 call |Call !!MdsMirrorFT50()|
      button .Hand     at xmax+0.1 ymin tooltip 'Rotate Frame'   pixmap width 18 height 18 call |Call !!MdsRotateFrame(!!MdsFT50)|
      button .AlignSup at xmax+0.1 ymin tooltip 'Align Support'  pixmap width 18 height 18 call |Call !!Mdsxalign(!!MdsFT50)|
      button .ModSctn  at xmax+0.1 ymin tooltip 'Modify Section' pixmap width 18 height 18 call |Call !!MdsPosse(!!MdsFT50)|


-- Icons Row 2

      button .AddPack       at x1 ymax+0.25 tooltip 'Add Packer'         pixmap width 18 height 18 call |Call !!Mdscrft25(!!MdsFT50)|
      button .DelPack       at xmax+0.1 ymin tooltip 'Delete Packer'      pixmap width 18 height 18 call |Call !!Mdsdelft25(!!MdsFT50)|
      button .Rotate        at xmax+0.1 ymin tooltip 'Rotate Atta'        pixmap width 18 height 18 call |Call !!MdsIRotan(!!MdsFT50,'!!MdsRotateFT50()')|
      button .RotAtt        at xmax+0.1 ymin tooltip 'Rotate Atta'        pixmap width 18 height 18 call ||
      button .Newdat        at xmax+0.1 ymin tooltip 'Modify Datum Atta'  pixmap width 18 height 18 call |Call !!Mdsnewdatum(!!MdsFT50)|
      button .Bedplate      at xmax+0.1 ymin tooltip 'Reference Bed/Anchor Plate' pixmap width 18 height 18 call |Call !!MdsIBedPlate(!!MdsFT50,'FRAME')|
      button .Associate     at xmax+0.1 ymin tooltip 'Associate Atta'     pixmap width 18 height 18 call |Call !!MdsLinkAtta(!!MdsFT50)|
